{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fascinating hidden object journey through the mystical world of history and nature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient artifacts, explore the mysterious temples of Egypt, roam through the dense, green jungle full of exotic animals and hidden treasures, and explore ancient Rome with its magnificent buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the various levels to be unlocked are fascinating hidden object pictures and puzzle games on topics such as: museum, Egypt, Asia, the jungle, and ancient Rome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also find objects by sound, develop your detective skills in a study, search for constellations, or paint pictures by numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden objects, discover exciting details and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun searching, discovering and marveling on this exciting hidden object journey! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919280?t=1756360991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919280?t=1756360991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919280/f50a6a0d7d389f9a180cedfd1225f5cc28888ce8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756360991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919280/f50a6a0d7d389f9a180cedfd1225f5cc28888ce8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756360991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fascinating hidden object journey through the mystical world of history and nature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient artifacts, explore the mysterious temples of Egypt, roam through the dense, green jungle full of exotic animals and hidden treasures, and explore ancient Rome with its magnificent buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the various levels to be unlocked are fascinating hidden object pictures and puzzle games on topics such as: museum, Egypt, Asia, the jungle, and ancient Rome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also find objects by sound, develop your detective skills in a study, search for constellations, or paint pictures by numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden objects, discover exciting details and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun searching, discovering and marveling on this exciting hidden object journey! </p>","developers":["magnussoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919280/03df38f0f2246e54d5d220b2d0a08b75c0be3993/header.jpg?t=1756360991","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3919280/1256491084/8600487c0986b168c25800388d6f0a656358678c/1753881601/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754933581","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3919280/1256491084/8600487c0986b168c25800388d6f0a656358678c/1753881601/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754933581","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3919280/1256491084/8600487c0986b168c25800388d6f0a656358678c/1753881601/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754933581","id":257175742,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175742/movie480.mp4?t=1754933581","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175742/movie_max.mp4?t=1754933581"},"na